#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0581 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: None of TRTP, TRTPGy, TRTA, and TRTAGy are present and none of the character treatment variables in ADSL defined in the IG are present
#note "Only TR01AG2 is present, a member of TRxxAGy (without TR01AG1). Requirements.Variables.None lists TRxxAGy, so the rule skips: a treatment variable of that family exists, and a BDS dataset need not carry the family's first member."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col TR01AG2 type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 12.5 | X
